  "releaseNotes": "Improve extensibility and add interfaces (ICacheKeyGenerator, IHeaderKeyGenerator, IUserKeyGenerator) for can customize each step in the CacheKey to identify the cache. Have a default handlers. Improved Cache using also Response Headers.",
